            "review_title": "Review at Pho Ly Quoc Su",
            "review_text": "Brian T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam40 contributions\n0\nGood Pho\nOct 2016 • Friends\nI've enjoyed at Pho Ly Quoc Su at 10 Ly Quoc Su street, that's so crowded in afternoon. I must wait 10 mins to get table. \nThe Pho is vey good, but I recommended you if you can't eat spicy, you shouldn't eat chili sauce in the table, because it's very spicy..\nI ate well done Pho, the rate is 55.000vnd per bowl.\nHighly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
